# Citation metadata for the mzTab-M specification repository.
# GitHub shows this as "Cite this repository"; see https://citation-file-format.github.io/
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the mzTab-M format, please cite the mzTab-M publication below.
  If you use the jmzTab-M reference implementation (parser, writer, validator
  or web validator), please also cite the jmzTab-M publication.
title: "mzTab-M: exchange format for metabolomics results"
abstract: >-
  mzTab-M is a tab-delimited file format for reporting quantitative results
  of mass spectrometry-based metabolomics and lipidomics experiments,
  developed by the HUPO Proteomics Standards Initiative (PSI) in
  collaboration with the Metabolomics Standards Initiative (MSI). This
  repository holds the specification, the JSON schema, example files and
  the documentation site.
authors:
  - name: "HUPO Proteomics Standards Initiative (PSI) Metabolomics Working Group"
    website: "https://www.psidev.info/metabolomics"
repository-code: "https://github.com/HUPO-PSI/mzTab-M"
url: "https://hupo-psi.github.io/mzTab-M/"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - mzTab-M
  - metabolomics
  - lipidomics
  - mass spectrometry
  - data standard
  - HUPO-PSI
